{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 10, "data": [{"docid2": 2275103, "bgxz": "市政府规章", "chnl": "市政府规章", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202608/t20260820_2275103.htm", "content": "\n2026年3月12日，《中华人民共和国生态环境法典》由中华人民共和国第十四届全国人民代表大会第四次会议通过，自2026年8月15日起施行。为了维护法制统一，决定对以下不符合生态环境法典规定的市政府规章作出修改：\n一", "docabstract": "（2026年8月16日三明市人民政府令第13号公布 自公布之日起施行）", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202608/t20260820_2275103.htm", "docreltime": "2026.08.17 15:16:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府关于修改部分规章的决定", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "三明市人民政府令 第13号", "idxid": "SM00100-0200-2026-00071", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2026.08.16 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 2489711, "sourcename": "三明市人民政府办公室", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202608/t20260820_2275103.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市人民政府关于修改部分规章的决定.docx", "appdocid": 2275103, "appfile": "P020260902314872991362.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202608/t20260820_2275103.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202609/P020260902/P020260902314872991362.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202608/P020260902314872991362.docx"}, {"appdesc": "三明市人民政府关于修改部分规章的决定.pdf", "appdocid": 2275103, "appfile": "P020260820568237382978.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202608/t20260820_2275103.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202608/P020260820/P020260820568237382978.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202608/P020260820568237382978.pdf"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202608/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2190069, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政府规章", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202602/t20260212_2190069.htm", "content": "\n　　第一条  为了加强健康影响评估工作，有效防范重大健康安全风险，推进健康三明建设，提升公民健康水平，促进经济社会协调可持续发展，根据《中华人民共和国基本医疗卫生与健康促进法》等法律、法规，结合本", "docabstract": "（2026年2月10日三明市人民政府令第12号公布 自2026年5月1日起施行）", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202602/t20260212_2190069.htm", "docreltime": "2026.02.10 10:22:00", "doctitle": "三明市健康影响评估暂行规定", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "三明市人民政府令 第12号", "idxid": "SM00100-0200-2026-00027", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2026.02.10 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 2398603, "sourcename": "政府信息公开办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202602/t20260212_2190069.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市健康影响评估暂行规定.docx", "appdocid": 2190069, "appfile": "P020260212390836600771.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202602/t20260212_2190069.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202602/P020260212/P020260212390836600771.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202602/P020260212390836600771.docx"}, {"appdesc": "三明市健康影响评估暂行规定.pdf", "appdocid": 2190069, "appfile": "P020260212390837168208.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202602/t20260212_2190069.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202602/P020260212/P020260212390837168208.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202602/P020260212390837168208.pdf"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202602/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2176368, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政府规章", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202512/t20251212_2176368.htm", "content": "\n　　第一条  为了加强和规范人工防雹安全管理，提升安全作业能力，防御和减轻冰雹灾害，服务农业生产，保障人民生活，促进经济社会高质量发展，根据《中华人民共和国气象法》、《人工影响天气管理条例》和《福", "docabstract": "（2025年12月5日三明市人民政府令第11号公布 自2026年3月1日起施行）", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202512/t20251212_2176368.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.08 15:59:00", "doctitle": "三明市人工防雹安全管理办法", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "三明市人民政府令第11号", "idxid": "SM00100-0200-2025-00126", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2025.12.05 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 2382265, "sourcename": "三明市人民政府办公室", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202512/t20251212_2176368.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市人工防雹安全管理办法.docx", "appdocid": 2176368, "appfile": "P020251212590237439264.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202512/t20251212_2176368.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202512/P020251212/P020251212590237439264.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202512/P020251212590237439264.docx"}, {"appdesc": "三明市人工防雹安全管理办法.pdf", "appdocid": 2176368, "appfile": "P020251212591010129464.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202512/t20251212_2176368.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202512/P020251212/P020251212591010129464.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202512/P020251212591010129464.pdf"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202512/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2122747, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政府规章", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202505/t20250513_2122747.htm", "content": "\n　　第一条  为了规范和促进矛盾纠纷多元预防化解工作，保障当事人合法权益，提高社会治理现代化水平，建设平安三明、法治三明，根据《福建省多元化解纠纷条例》和有关法律、法规，结合本市实际，制定本办法。", "docabstract": "（2025年4月30日三明市人民政府令第10号公布 自2025年7月1日起施行）", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202505/t20250513_2122747.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.30 16:16:00", "doctitle": "三明市矛盾纠纷多元预防化解办法", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "三明市人民政府令第10号", "idxid": "SM00100-0200-2025-00058", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2025.04.30 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 2318964, "sourcename": "政府信息公开办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202505/t20250513_2122747.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市矛盾纠纷多元预防化解办法.docx", "appdocid": 2122747, "appfile": "P020250929335010787560.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202505/t20250513_2122747.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202509/P020250929/P020250929335010787560.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202505/P020250929335010787560.docx"}, {"appdesc": "三明市矛盾纠纷多元预防化解办法.pdf", "appdocid": 2122747, "appfile": "P020250929335010902012.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202505/t20250513_2122747.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202509/P020250929/P020250929335010902012.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202505/P020250929335010902012.pdf"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202505/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1882404, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政府规章", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202302/t20230224_1882404.htm", "content": "第一条  为了加强生活垃圾分类管理，改善城乡人居环境，推进生态文明建设，根据《中华人民共和国固体废物污染环境防治法》《福建省城乡生活垃圾管理条例》等法律、法规，结合本市实际，制定本办法。\n第二条  ", "docabstract": "（2023年2月7日三明市人民政府令第9号公布 自2023年7月1日起施行）", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202302/t20230224_1882404.htm", "docreltime": "2023.02.24 16:19:00", "doctitle": "三明市生活垃圾分类管理办法", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "三明市人民政府令第9号", "idxid": "SM00100-0200-2023-00191", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2023.02.07 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 2028419, "sourcename": "政府信息公开办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202302/t20230224_1882404.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市生活垃圾分类管理办法.pdf", "appdocid": 1882404, "appfile": "P020230224605068617487.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202302/t20230224_1882404.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202302/P020230224/P020230224605068617487.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202302/P020230224605068617487.pdf"}, {"appdesc": "三明市生活垃圾分类管理办法.docx", "appdocid": 1882404, "appfile": "P020230224605072321053.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202302/t20230224_1882404.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202302/P020230224/P020230224605072321053.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202302/P020230224605072321053.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202302/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1738723, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "市政府规章", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202112/t20211217_1738723.htm", "content": "\n\n\n\n第一章  总  则\n \n第一条  为了加强停车场的规划、建设和管理，保障停车需求，规范停车秩序，改善交通状况，根据《中华人民共和国道路交通安全法》《中华人民共和国城乡规划法》《福建省实施〈中华人", "docabstract": "（2021年2月9日三明市人民政府令第7号公布  自2021年4月1日起施行）", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202112/t20211217_1738723.htm", "docreltime": "2021.02.09 09:23:00", "doctitle": "三明市停车场管理办法", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "三明市人民政府令第7号", "idxid": "SM00100-0200-2021-0001", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2021.02.09 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人民政府", "recid": 1855235, "sourcename": "三明市人民政府门户网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/szfgz/202112/t20211217_1738723.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "7三明市停车场管理办法.docx", "appdocid": 1738723, "appfile": "P020211217414172707676.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "ht